s, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, and November to December was 39% of normal in 2025. All 5 grids had their driest year in 1988, with grid 18793 at 64% of normal in 1988.</p>"}
